Boehm-Demers-Weiser conservative garbage collector (bdwgc) 8.2.12
https://github.com/bdwgc/bdwgc

Upstream 8.2.12 ships no separate LICENSE file: the notice below is the
"Copyright & Warranty" section of the distribution's own README.md, which is
vendored beside this file unmodified. It is reproduced here under the
conventional name so the installers can ship it (packaging/femm-qt.iss,
macos_build.sh) alongside the other components' licences.

The GPL'd files the last paragraph mentions are GNU build-system helpers
(config.guess, ltmain.sh and friends). None of them is vendored here -- see
FEMM-VENDORED.md for exactly what was kept.

----------------------------------------------------------------------

